I wanted to do that.

295
00:24:29.680 --> 00:24:31.489
That's, uh, that's okay.

296
00:24:32.279 --> 00:24:33.640
Oh, jeez.

297
00:24:37.160 --> 00:24:39.279
I'm still chewing my food.

298
00:24:39.359 --> 00:24:41.759
That's... No, wait, that's disgusting.

299
