if you stopped looking for her.

417
00:37:24.599 --> 00:37:27.284
Maybe you don't like what you find.

418
00:37:53.400 --> 00:37:55.322
Detective Sloan?

419
00:37:56.880 --> 00:37:58.239
Yeah, um,

420
00:37:58.320 --> 00:38:01.880
