434
00:39:35.599 --> 00:39:40.242
Well, it's kind of out
of my control, so...

435
00:39:44.920 --> 00:39:47.206
What is it that you want?

436
00:39:49.480 --> 00:39:50.969
What are you after?

437
00:39:56.800 --> 00:39:58.688
You.

438
00:41:31.119 --> 00:41:32.963
Oh, shit.

439
00:41:42.920 --> 00:41:46.481
